{
  "date": "2026-11-10",
  "category": "finance",
  "title_zh": "中国10月消费价格涨0.7%，工厂出厂价格涨5.7%",
  "title_en": "China's October consumer prices rise 0.7%, factory-gate prices rise 5.7%",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "11月9日，国家统计局公布了10月的物价数据。居民消费价格指数（CPI）表示居民买商品和服务的价格变化。和去年同期相比，CPI上涨0.7%，涨幅比9月小0.2个百分点。和9月相比，CPI没有变化。",
      "en": "On November 9, the National Bureau of Statistics published October's price data. The Consumer Price Index (CPI) shows how the prices of goods and services that residents buy change. Compared with the same period last year, CPI rose 0.7%, an increase 0.2 percentage points smaller than September's. Compared with September, CPI did not change."
    },
    {
      "zh": "工业生产者出厂价格指数（PPI）表示工厂卖出产品的价格变化。和去年同期相比，PPI上涨5.7%，涨幅比9月大0.7个百分点，是2022年7月以来的最高水平。和9月相比，PPI上涨0.7%，涨幅比9月小0.5个百分点。",
      "en": "The Producer Price Index (PPI) shows how the prices of products sold by factories change. Compared with the same period last year, PPI rose 5.7%, an increase 0.7 percentage points larger than September's and the highest level since July 2022. Compared with September, PPI rose 0.7%, an increase 0.5 percentage points smaller than September's."
    },
    {
      "zh": "在消费方面，食品价格比去年同期下降2.9%。汽油价格上涨22.4%，能源价格整体上涨9.9%。服务价格上涨0.7%，手机、电脑等电子产品的价格也涨得比较多。",
      "en": "On the consumer side, food prices fell 2.9% from the same period last year. Gasoline prices rose 22.4%, and energy prices overall rose 9.9%. Service prices rose 0.7%, and prices of electronic products such as phones and computers also rose quite a lot."
    },
    {
      "zh": "在工业方面，煤炭开采价格上涨36.6%，石油和天然气开采价格上涨35.0%，石油和煤炭加工价格上涨29.9%。这样，PPI和CPI的涨幅差距扩大到了5个百分点。",
      "en": "On the industrial side, coal mining prices rose 36.6%, oil and natural gas extraction prices rose 35.0%, and oil and coal processing prices rose 29.9%. As a result, the gap between the PPI and CPI increases widened to 5 percentage points."
    }
  ],
